<title>GERMANY: Kohl-German interest to uphold EMU treaty, criteria.</title>
<headline>Kohl-German interest to uphold EMU treaty, criteria.</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>German chancellor Helmut Kohl said on Friday it was in Germany's interest to uphold the criteria and timetable laid out in the Maastricht Treaty for membership in the planned single European currency.</p>
<p>He also said the 1998 German elections would not be impacted by the efforts of other countries to join currency union.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
